    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "14 College Close, Dunshaughlin, is a well presented 3-bedroom, 1-bathroom detached house in a mature residential area. The property features a bright open plan kitchen/dinning room, comfortable living room with fireplace, off street parking, front and rear gardens.\r\nThe home offers excellent potential for modernization and is conveniently located close to Dunshaughlin village, local schools, shops and amenities. \r\nThis property is situated within the popular small development of College Close\r\nViewing is highly recommended.\r\nContact John Bannon 086 8320042"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Front Pourch.\r\nWith vinyl floors.\r\nEntrance Hall \t2.9 x 2.1\r\nCarpet floor.\r\nKitchen/Dining\t   8.3 x 3.7\r\nKitchen with vinyl flooring, wall and floor units. Carpet floor.Solid wood doors and side entrance to back yard. \r\nSitting Room\t4.1 x 3.8\t\r\nCarpet floor. living room with fireplace and back boiler.\t\t\r\nBedroom 1\t\t3.1 x 2.9\r\nCarpet floors.\r\nBuilt-in wardrobes and curtains.\r\nBedroom 2 \t2.6 x 4.2\r\nCarpet floors.\t\t\t\r\nBedroom 3\t\t2.8 x 2.9\r\nCarpet floors.\r\nFamily Bathroom\t 1.8 x 2.3 \r\nVinyl floors and W.C. W.H.B. and large bath.\r\nGardens\t\t\r\nBack garden with shed.\r\nWest face back garden.\r\nServices\tOil boiler burner for central heating. \r\nMains water and sewerage."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Mature small estate.\r\nCul de sac location.\r\nDouble glazed windows. \r\nConvenient location, walking distance to town, array of services & amenities closes by.\r\nFace a large green area.\r\nDouble side gate.\r\n3 car parking spaces.\r\nLarge side area with double door access. \r\nFront patio.\r\nGarden with shed.\r\nWest face back garden."
      },
